        ":question/id": "3ffc1e55-73ec-5b55-8161-212b52269e64",
        ":question/math-academy-id": "q-275408",
        ":question/problem": "Calculate $C+D-E$, where\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 5 \\\\ 5 & -1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$D=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -4 \\\\ 4 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$E=\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 5 \\\\ -4 & 2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$C+D-E=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td><td>{{field-2}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-3}}</td><td>{{field-4}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>",
        ":question/worked-solution": "Performing the operations on each corresponding entry, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}C+D-E & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 5 \\\\ 5 & -1\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -4 \\\\ 4 & 1\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 5 \\\\ -4 & 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}3+2-6 & 5+(-4)-5 \\\\ 5+4-(-4) & -1+1-2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -4 \\\\ 13 & -2\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"
