        ":question/problem": "Calculate $A+B-C$, where\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 5\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 3 \\\\ -2 & 4\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 5 \\\\ 3 & -1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$A+B-C=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td><td>{{field-2}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-3}}</td><td>{{field-4}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>",
        ":question/worked-solution": "Performing the operations on each corresponding entry, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A+B-C & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 5\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 3 \\\\ -2 & 4\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 5 \\\\ 3 & -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}4+2-1 & -1+3-5 \\\\ 0+(-2)-3 & 5+4-(-1)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}5 & -3 \\\\ -5 & 10\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"
