        ":question/id": "5fac0bcf-16ed-5b9d-89c1-092efedf4ced",
        ":question/math-academy-id": "q-279526",
        ":question/problem": "Calculate $X+Y+Z$, where\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$X=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 5 \\\\ 7 & -2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$Y=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 1 \\\\ 4 & 3\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$Z=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$X+Y+Z=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td><td>{{field-2}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-3}}</td><td>{{field-4}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>",
        ":question/worked-solution": "Performing the operations on each corresponding entry, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}X+Y+Z & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 5 \\\\ 7 & -2\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 1 \\\\ 4 & 3\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}0+(-2)+3 & 5+1+(-1) \\\\ 7+4+(-1) & -2+3+2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 5 \\\\ 10 & 3\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"
      },
