        ":question/math-academy-id": "q-279527",
        ":question/problem": "Calculate $A-(B-C)$, where\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -2 \\\\ 7 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 5 \\\\ 0 & -4\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 \\\\ 6 & 3\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$A-(B-C)=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td><td>{{field-2}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-3}}</td><td>{{field-4}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>",
        ":question/worked-solution": "Performing the operations on each corresponding entry, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A-(B-C) & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -2 \\\\ 7 & 1\\end{bmatrix}-(\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 5 \\\\ 0 & -4\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 \\\\ 6 & 3\\end{bmatrix}) \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -2 \\\\ 7 & 1\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}3-1 & 5-2 \\\\ 0-6 & -4-3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -2 \\\\ 7 & 1\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 3 \\\\ -6 & -7\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}4-2 & -2-3 \\\\ 7-(-6) & 1-(-7)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -5 \\\\ 13 & 8\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"
