        ":question/id": "73b987f0-305e-5d8c-ab05-3b95561f2735",
        ":question/math-academy-id": "q-279528",
        ":question/problem": "Calculate $X+(Y-Z)$, where\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$X=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 6 \\\\ 2 & 5\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$Y=\\begin{bmatrix}9 & 8 \\\\ 3 & 7\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$Z=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 4\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$X+(Y-Z)=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td><td>{{field-2}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-3}}</td><td>{{field-4}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>",
        ":question/worked-solution": "Performing the operations on each corresponding entry, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}X+(Y-Z) & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 6 \\\\ 2 & 5\\end{bmatrix}+(\\begin{bmatrix}9 & 8 \\\\ 3 & 7\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 4\\end{bmatrix}) \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 6 \\\\ 2 & 5\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}9-2 & 8-3 \\\\ 3-1 & 7-4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 6 \\\\ 2 & 5\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 5 \\\\ 2 & 3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}4+7 & 6+5 \\\\ 2+2 & 5+3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}11 & 11 \\\\ 4 & 8\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"
