        ":question/id": "e246298e-b199-57d7-a768-a8e9c865e179",
        ":question/math-academy-id": "q-279469",
        ":question/problem": "Calculate $A-B+C$, where\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -1 \\\\ 7 & 2\\end{bmatrix},\\,B=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 5 \\\\ 1 & -3\\end{bmatrix},\\,C=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 6 \\\\ 2 & 4\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\n<table align=\"l\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"30px\" rowspan=\"2\">$A-B+C=\\,\\,$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"30px\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">{{field-1}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\">{{field-2}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">{{field-3}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"30px\">{{field-4}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
        ":question/worked-solution": "Performing the operations on each corresponding entry, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A-B+C & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -1 \\\\ 7 & 2\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 5 \\\\ 1 & -3\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 6 \\\\ 2 & 4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}3-4+0 & -1-5+6 \\\\ 7-1+2 & 2-(-3)+4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 \\\\ 8 & 9\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"
      },
